  m_text: 'You are Sejanus! The Prefect of the Praetorian Guard in the powerful Roman
    Empire. Your emperor Tiberius is growing old and feeble as he secludes himself
    on the Isle of Capri. Now is your chance to usurp the throne and claim the power
    of empire for yourself! You have several inscrutable agents who will do your
    bidding, a list of missions that will increase your legitimacy, and now is the
    time to act! Be wary or watchful, you must maintain secrecy. '
