  isAvailable: 0
  mission:
    missionName: Buy the Vote
    missionDescription: All our hard work has born us this opportunity, we simply
      need to reach out and seize it. Several town council members find their coffers
      light. Send an agent to persuade them of our legitimacy and make sure that
      they are well compensated. Best to use someone who blends into crowds.
    turns:
    - turnDescription: The Pleb puts up a fight!
      requiresCheck: 1
      conflictTarget: 0
      guileTarget: 6
      rhetoricTarget: 9
      successText: Success!
      failText: Failure!
      successOutcomes:
      - statName: Legitimacy
